      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Intimidate 5 ranks, Warp sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can teleport suddenly and in an ominous burst of magic, leaping forward in an unexpected and terrifying display. After you appear, you can attempt an Intimidate check to demoralize an opponent in range (demoralize normally has a range of 30 feet) as a free action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/warp#toc89\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
